{"type":1061,"values":["Oct 2025 Simon Faulkner. Added Satara-Kaukau track section of Korimako Track. Tidied up Awarua-Ridvan section of Korimako. Tidied up tracks etc around Simla-Khandallah Park, and general tidy-ups around Simla Station, Nairnville Park, Bankot/Mysore. Tidied up track and cliffs on Huntleigh-Awarua section of Korimako, but the area off the track could do with some attetion (looks usable: mostly passable, not extremely steep, some terrain and rock features).\r\nAdded some vegetation (difficult to map) and two old bait tracks below the new Satara-Kaukau track; these tracks are set to purple \"taped route\" becuase they maybe should not be shown? They are indistinct (pink squares and faint intermittent ground trail) and have some sections that pass through or above cliffs that are a bit tricky."]},
